              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "karinagw"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I, too, scaled it down to 1 and it scaled perfectly, altho, I tend to eyeball amounts &amp; probably erred a little on the plus size. (For the record, the division scales down to 1.25 oz each of amaretto &amp; tequila &amp; half an oz of orange liqueur (I used Grand Marnier. Will try it with Triple Sec next time) I'm not sure with an almost 1:1 ratio of s&amp;s to alcohol, anyone cannot taste the alcohol.). I also used granulated sugar instead of confectioners. I like texture/sweetness level better.",
            "datePublished": "2012-07-13T13:33:58.487Z"
          },
          {
